RAWRXD_RESIDUAL_OVERLAY_FINAL_001
==================================
THE COMPLETE EXPERT + DENSE POPULATION. EVERY CLASS MEASURED.
21 CASES. 0 UNMEASURED CLASSES REMAIN THAT WERE REACHABLE.

MODEL A (dense) F:\OllamaModels\blobs\sha256-6150cb38...   19.85 GB
MODEL B (MoE)   F:\OllamaModels\blobs\sha256-764636b0...  103.99 GB
                 GGUF v3, 1328 tensors, 43 layers, arch=deepseek4, TRUE MoE
TOOL    rawrxd/certs/gguf_tensor_slice_001.cpp
TABLES  rawrxd/certs/iq_tables.inc  (GENERATED, see section 4)
WINDOW  256 rows x 1024 cols; dense matrix used 256x256 for comparability


----------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. TYPE MAP -- CORRECTED AGAINST THE AUTHORITATIVE ENUM
----------------------------------------------------------------------------
An earlier receipt asserted 17=IQ2_XXS, 18=IQ2_XS, 26=IQ4_XS FROM MEMORY.
Reading ggml.h gives:

  ID  NAME       count  tensor                        what it actually is
  --  --------   -----  ----------------------------  ---------------------
   0  F32          662  output_hc_base.weight
   8  Q8_0         317  blk.0.attn_kv.weight
  12  Q4_K           -  (dense model: 385)             dense attention/ffn_up
  14  Q6_K         174  output.weight                  dense ffn_down
  17  IQ2_XS        50  blk.N.ffn_gate_exps.weight     ROUTED EXPERTS
  18  IQ3_XXS       77  blk.N.ffn_down_exps.weight    ROUTED EXPERTS
  26  I32            3  blk.N.ffn_gate_tid2eid.weight  a plain int32 ROUTING
                                                         TABLE, not a quant
  30  BF16          43  blk.N.ffn_gate_inp.weight      the router
  39  MXFP4          2  blk.41/42.ffn_down_exps.weight ROUTED EXPERTS

THREE OF FOUR EARLIER NAMES WERE WRONG. IQ3_XXS is a 3-bit format, not the
2-bit one previously described, and it uses a different codebook scheme.
Type 26 is not a quantisation at all -- its name says "tid to eid", and it is
int32. The corrected reading also shows the expert mix is NOT uniform: gate and
down projections alternate between IQ2_XS and IQ3_XXS across layers.


