  DENSE_Q4_K                     REFUTED   8/8
  DENSE_Q6_K                     REFUTED   3/3
  MOE_EXPERT_IQ2_XS              REFUTED   1/1
  MOE_EXPERT_IQ3_XXS             REFUTED   5/5
  MOE_EXPERT_MXFP4               REFUTED   4/4
  LOW_RANK_BEATS_ORDER0          0 / 21
  RESIDUAL_OVERLAY_COMPRESSION   NOT VIABLE on every reachable class

  THE ONE THING THAT MIGHT STILL WORK: a residual whose base is chosen
  SPECIFICALLY to make the correction low-rank or sparse -- i.e. a base that is
  not simply the coarsest quantisation available, but optimised so its error
  lives in few directions. That is a different proposal from the one measured,
  and it is testable with exactly this harness.